{"id":47796,"imdb":"tt0056215","en":"Mamma Roma","orig":"Mamma Roma","ar":null,"tag":null,"ov":"After years spent working as a prostitute in her Italian village, middle-aged Mamma Roma has saved enough money to buy herself a fruit stand so that she can have a respectable middle-class life and reestablish contact with the 16-year-old son she abandoned when he was an infant. But her former pimp threatens to expose her sordid past, and her troubled son seems destined to fall into a life of crime and violence.","rd":"1962-09-22","rt":110,"g":[18],"lang":"it","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Arco Film","logo":null,"c":"IT"}],"countries":["IT"],"langs":["Italian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"IT","d":"1962-09-22"},{"c":"US","d":"1965-01-18"},{"c":"HU","d":"1965-08-19"},{"c":"PL","d":"1974-10-13"},{"c":"FR","d":"1976-01-07"},{"c":"GR","d":"2003-01-20"},{"c":"NL","d":"2008-10-14"},{"c":"KR","d":"2025-08-20"}],"dir":["Pier Paolo Pasolini"],"prod":["Alfredo Bini"],"wri":["Pier Paolo Pasolini"],"mus":["Carlo Rustichelli","Antonio Vivaldi"],"dop":["Tonino Delli Colli"],"cast":[{"n":"Anna Magnani","ch":"Mamma Roma","p":"/iT6FUf7z5O2N9OOZFxhreVWRHYp.jpg"},{"n":"Ettore Garofolo","ch":"Ettore","p":"/6ANRLH7WzzWMUaqJZkc5WAsDpYX.jpg"},{"n":"Franco Citti","ch":"Carmine","p":"/8FTMiz5JYOOXPy8pYXwqoDlAM7M.jpg"},{"n":"Silvana Corsini","ch":"Bruna","p":"/3vjgxz4nRX6ZGKi5KA1zlRW3prS.jpg"},{"n":"Luisa Loiano","ch":"Biancofiore","p":null},{"n":"Paolo Volponi","ch":"Priest","p":"/eCWWxSUtqudxWynnLR2qwHjb1A6.jpg"},{"n":"Luciano Gonini","ch":"Zacaria","p":null},{"n":"Vittorio La Paglia","ch":"Il Signor Pellissier","p":null},{"n":"Piero Morgia","ch":"Piero","p":"/7NfQqNRAGFUh3CtF84i67qt2ulO.jpg"},{"n":"Franco Ceccarelli","ch":"Carletto","p":null},{"n":"Marcello Sorrentino","ch":"Tonino","p":null},{"n":"Sandro Meschino","ch":"Pasquale","p":null},{"n":"Franco Tovo","ch":"Augusto","p":null},{"n":"Pasquale Ferrarese","ch":"Lino","p":null},{"n":"Leandro Santarelli","ch":"Begalo","p":null},{"n":"E